'''Mom's Dead Hands''' behave similarly to regular Mom's Hands. When they land, they send out 3-4 lines of rock waves in the cardinal directions that can curve slightly and will destroy most obstacles and damage most monsters in its path. Upon death, they spawn 2-3 {{e|Spider}}s. Unlike normal Mom's Hands, they can't grab and teleport Isaac.
