== Notes ==
* The rock waves that Mom's Dead Hands spawn can open {{r|Secret Room}}s and {{r|Super Secret Room}}s.
{{dlc clear}}{{clear}}

== Trivia ==
* The Hands are likely inspired by Wallmasters from the [[wikipedia:Legend of Zelda|''The Legend of Zelda'']].
* If Mom's Hand catches Isaac in a {{r|Challenge Room}}, it will teleport him out of the room without having to fight the remaining enemy waves, even if the room is re-entered.
* Mom's Hand is the only enemy in the game that can teleport Isaac to a different room.
* {{p|Emergency Contact}} card spawns two Mom's Hands that grab enemies.

